- **Reversible migrations (mandatory read):** `.cursor/pm/DB_REVERSIBLE_MIGRATIONS.md` — convention, runner, your obligations. Migrations live in `scripts/migrations/`; runner: `scripts/db/run_migration.py` (list / up / down).
- **Brain (rec.io DB context):** `.cursor/pm/brain/03_db_schema_brain.md` — connection, schemas, critical tables, init_database, reversible migrations pointer.
